> $s
> [1] 0.9999659
>
> $p
> [1] 1.1000313 0.1000028
>
> $r
> [1] 0.8332812
>
> $s.start
> [1] 1.100031
>
> $s.end
> [1] 2.099997
>
> $first
> [1] "pause"
> ```
